Learning Outcome Alignment
LO4: Proficient use of CLI tools and monitoring scripts
LO5: Critical evaluation of OS behavior and optimisation trade-offs
Reflection (Week 6)
Week 6 highlighted the importance of quantitative performance analysis in a secure, controlled environment. Measuring CPU, memory, disk, and network metrics revealed real-world bottlenecks and helped implement targeted optimisations. Combining security and performance considerations ensures a balanced system configuration.
